# What EAS Build uploads.
#
# EAS archives from the git root, so a monorepo ships everything beside the
# app unless told otherwise. Without this file the archive was 747 MB and the
# upload was rejected outright — son-portrait-3d alone is 1.7 GB.
#
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for the archive, so
# the usual exclusions have to be repeated here. Adding a path to .gitignore
# is not enough to keep it out of a build.
#
# The iOS build reads mobile/ and nothing else: no workspaces, no file: deps,
# no imports that leave that directory.

# Siblings the app never reads
/son-portrait-3d/
/web/
/packages/
/docs/
/graphify-out/
/.impeccable/
/*.png
/*.md
/*.txt

# Dependencies and build output — restated, since .gitignore no longer applies
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
.next/
out/

# Native projects are regenerated by prebuild on the build machine
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/android/

# Local-only
.env
.env*.local
.vercel/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Source imagery kept for reference, not shipped in the bundle
/mobile/assets/simulation-images/
